== Effects ==
* While holding the trinket, all items in the {{r|Shop}} are free.
** After purchasing anything there, the trinket disappears.
** This trinket only works on monetary transactions within the Shop.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}}: Does not disappear on use. Purchasing an item has a 25% chance to turn into a regular store credit trinket and 75% to remain golden.

== Interaction ==
* {{I|Keeper's Box}}: Cannot be used on items/pickups spawned outside of the Shop.
* {{I|The Stairway}}: Cannot be used on the items/pickups found in the special Angel room.
* {{i|Marbles}} / {{i|Smelter}} / [[Pills|Gulp!]] pills: Store Credit's effect will only happen once after being absorbed.
* {{I|A Pound of Flesh}}: Store Credit becomes a useless trinket, as neither Devil Deals nor shop items will become free.

